'''Salon Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that was introduced in [[Version 2.0 Update|Version 2.0]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]]. This unit is a stronger variant of [[Actress Cat (Special Cat)|Actress Cat]] with better stats. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 6.9 Update|Version 6.9]] increases attack power and gains [[Immune to Weaken|Weaken Immunity]]. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 10.6 Update|Version 10.6]]. In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], Salon Cat is unlocked into the Rare Capsule pool once clearing [[Saudi Arabia (Empire of Cats)|Saudi Arabia]].

